    "detailed_description": "<h1>Review the demo!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Under, <i>&quot;Download Pin City Demo&quot;</i> click, <i>&quot;Learn more&quot;</i>\u00a0to get to the specific demo page and leave a review!<br><br>Leaving a review on the demo's Steam page will help us understand the things you like or don't like about our game. We are in mid-development and ready to hear your feedback before we release!  </p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>About this Game</strong><br>Pin City is a bowling game unlike any other bowling game you\u2019ve played before. We strove to bring the spirit of mini-golf into the world of bowling. We\u2019ve taken the standard bowling setup (straight lane, 10 pins, 1 ball) and expanded, transformed, and evolved it. We wanted to give people a chance to bowl in ways that would be impossible, illegal, or extremely impractical.<br><br><strong>Scoring / Structure</strong><br>At its core, Pin City is a bowling game. That means two throws per frame (three on the last frame), and standard spare and strike scoring apply. That being said, there may not always be the same amount of pins!<br><br><strong>Levels</strong><br>Pin City will have 50+ handcrafted levels spanning a wide range of mechanics to really challenge your bowling arm. The levels are 3 frames each, and are grouped into thematic chapters.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999830/extras/f67cebee112018fd30143875bb260c5f.poster.avif?t=1752815210\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999830/extras/f67cebee112018fd30143875bb260c5f.webm?t=1752815210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999830/extras/f67cebee112018fd30143875bb260c5f.mp4?t=1752815210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Mechanics</strong><br>The various mechanics we explore include (but are not limited to)<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Ramps &amp; topography!<br></li><li>Fire!<br></li><li>Gravity manipulation!<br></li><li>Hazards &amp; obstacles!<br></li><li>Absurdity!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999830/extras/ada76d43d5546b7a32578a7c60baea57.poster.avif?t=1752815210\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999830/extras/ada76d43d5546b7a32578a7c60baea57.webm?t=1752815210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999830/extras/ada76d43d5546b7a32578a7c60baea57.mp4?t=1752815210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999830/extras/1d8d4b6f8f7ad11d102b446ab365b867.poster.avif?t=1752815210\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999830/extras/1d8d4b6f8f7ad11d102b446ab365b867.webm?t=1752815210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999830/extras/1d8d4b6f8f7ad11d102b446ab365b867.mp4?t=1752815210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Setting</strong><br>You might be familiar with Pin City already. It\u2019s there, right on the edge of your hometown, a little old bowling alley that looks like it should be out of business, but somehow isn\u2019t. Outside is a cracked and peeling parking lot, watched over by a flickering and buzzing neon sign. When you enter, you\u2019re immediately greeted by the bright neon pattern of the carpet, and the oily aroma of fried food. There are outdated light fixtures above you, draping everything in a slightly yellow light. To your left is a rattling hum from the several aging vending machines. Bowling balls sit side by side in their racks, awaiting the hands of players. To your right on the shoe rental counter is a sign \u201cClosed for private event.\u201d Explore all it has to offer (and maybe find some fun easter eggs in the process!)<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999830/extras/5e30c0b5de684d28f0370d0e8846e894.poster.avif?t=1752815210\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999830/extras/5e30c0b5de684d28f0370d0e8846e894.webm?t=1752815210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999830/extras/5e30c0b5de684d28f0370d0e8846e894.mp4?t=1752815210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Features to Come</strong><br>These are features that are not yet in the game, but we plan on implementing before the final release.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Online highscores<br></li><li>More weird bowling strike animations<br></li><li>More refinement &amp; additions to environment<br></li><li>Online multiplayer </li></ul><br><strong>Possible Features</strong><br>These are features that are not a guarantee for the final release, but things we are excited about and are looking into.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Custom ball textures (Steam Workshop)<br></li><li>Custom hand textures (Steam Workshop)<br></li><li>Custom bowling lane creator (Steam Workshop)</li></ul>",
