tore_item_assets/steam/apps/1999830/extras/5e30c0b5de684d28f0370d0e8846e894.poster.avif?t=1752815210\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999830/extras/5e30c0b5de684d28f0370d0e8846e894.webm?t=1752815210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999830/extras/5e30c0b5de684d28f0370d0e8846e894.mp4?t=1752815210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Features to Come</strong><br>These are features that are not yet in the game, but we plan on implementing before the final release.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Online highscores<br></li><li>More weird bowling strike animations<br></li><li>More refinement &amp; additions to environment<br></li><li>Online multiplayer </li></ul><br><strong>Possible Features</strong><br>These are features that are not a guarantee for the final release, but things we are excited about and are looking into.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Custom ball textures (Steam Workshop)<br></li><li>Custom hand textures (Steam Workshop)<br></li><li>Custom bowling lane creator (Steam Workshop)</li></ul>",
